{"name":"Grilled Cheese","hex":"#ffc85f","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"grilled cheese","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A cheese sandwich typically toasted or fried in butter."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/grilled_cheese"}],"entries":[{"title":"Grilled cheese","blocks":[{"text":"A grilled cheese, toasted cheese sandwich, cheese toastie (UK), cheese jaffle (NZ/AU) or toastie (AU) is a hot cheese sandwich typically prepared by placing cheese between slices of bread and cooking with butter or mayonnaise on a frying pan, griddle, or pie iron, until the bread browns and the cheese melts. Despite its name, it is rarely prepared through grilling."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Classic_Grilled_Cheese_Sandwich_%2825791331763%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Classic_Grilled_Cheese_Sandwich_%2825791331763%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grilled_cheese","wikidata":"Q51796021"},{"title":"Grilling","blocks":[{"text":"Grilling is a form of cooking that involves heat applied to the surface of food, commonly from above, below or from the side. Grilling usually involves a significant amount of direct, radiant heat, and tends to be used for cooking meat and vegetables quickly. Food to be grilled is cooked on a grill, using a cast iron/frying pan, or a grill pan."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Grillen_-_BBQ_-_Barbeque_-_Fleisch_auf_dem_Grill.jpg/330px-Grillen_-_BBQ_-_Barbeque_-_Fleisch_auf_dem_Grill.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grilling","wikidata":"Q264619"},{"title":"Cheese","blocks":[{"text":"Cheese is a type of dairy product produced in a range of flavors, textures, and forms by curdling of milk, usually from cows, goats or sheep, and sometimes of water buffalo. During production, milk is usually acidified and either the enzymes of rennet or bacterial enzymes with similar activity are added to cause the protein casein to coagulate. The solid curds, consisting of proteins and milkfat, are then separated from the liquid whey and pressed into finished cheese. Some cheeses have aromatic molds on the outer layer or rind, while others have them throughout."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Cheese_platter.jpg/330px-Cheese_platter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheese","wikidata":"Q10943"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Grilled_cheese_sandwich_with_roasted_tomato_soup.jpg/500px-Grilled_cheese_sandwich_with_roasted_tomato_soup.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Grilled_cheese_sandwich_with_roasted_tomato_soup.jpg/1280px-Grilled_cheese_sandwich_with_roasted_tomato_soup.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Grilled_cheese_sandwich_with_roasted_tomato_soup.jpg/500px-Grilled_cheese_sandwich_with_roasted_tomato_soup.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A grilled cheese served with tomato soup","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGrilled_cheese_sandwich_with_roasted_tomato_soup.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dc/Hamburguesas_grill.jpg/500px-Hamburguesas_grill.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dc/Hamburguesas_grill.jpg/1280px-Hamburguesas_grill.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dc/Hamburguesas_grill.jpg/500px